#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/the-end.md:2
msgid "结语：现在你有一台真正能用的服务器了"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/the-end.md:4
msgid "这篇附录的目标很简单：**让你拿到一台GPU服务器后，能在一小时内让它开始跑深度学习代码**，而不是花一整天纠结驱动版本、SSH配置和Jupyter连不上。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/the-end.md:6
msgid "如果你是按顺序读下来的，你已经走过了这样一条路："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/the-end.md:24
msgid "这条路径上每一步都可能卡住新手："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/the-end.md:26
msgid "**Linux基础**卡在\"不知道sudo是什么意思\"、\"rm -rf /删了系统\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/the-end.md:27
msgid "**NVIDIA驱动**卡在\"Secure Boot阻止驱动加载\"、\"nvidia-smi报driver mismatch\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/the-end.md:28
msgid "**远程访问**卡在\"服务器没公网IP\"、\"Jupyter不让我连\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/the-end.md:29
msgid "**服务管理**卡在\"训练跑一半终端关了\"、\"服务器重启了怎么自动启动\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/the-end.md:31
msgid "每篇内容都在解决这些具体的痛点，而不是抽象地介绍工具。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/the-end.md:33
msgid "但这不是终点"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/the-end.md:35
msgid "这篇附录和主课程的关系很特别。主课程的知识是**线性的**——你从数学基础读到模型部署，一章接一章。但环境配置的知识是**放射状**的——你遇到什么问题，回来翻对应的那篇就行。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/the-end.md:37
msgid "你不会\"读完\"这篇附录就一劳永逸。真正的使用方式是："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/the-end.md:39
#, python-brace-format
msgid "第一次配服务器时顺序读{doc}`linux-basics`和{doc}`nvidia-setup`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/the-end.md:40
#, python-brace-format
msgid "遇到远程连接问题时翻{doc}`remote-access`，找到tailscale或frp的配置抄过去"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/the-end.md:41
#, python-brace-format
msgid "部署服务时再读{doc}`server-management`，用systemd把服务固定下来"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/the-end.md:43
msgid "记住一件事"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/the-end.md:46
msgid "环境配置的终极目标不是让你成为运维专家——而是让运维知识**不成为你做深度学习的障碍**。如果有一节内容你读完了觉得\"暂时用不上\"，那就对了，等你需要的时候它会在那里。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/the-end.md:51
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{doc}`../../index` 才是你的主战场。如果你是从这里开始的，现在可以回到{doc}`../../model-"
"serving/index` 或者{doc}`../../pytorch-"
"practice/index`选择你感兴趣的进阶方向了。训练脚本在等你，GPU在转，loss曲线在下降——这才是真正重要的事。"
msgstr ""

